# Test: OSPF read-only database web views; no inject route (both families).
#
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-ext-14 -- the opaque (IPv4) and OSPFv3 (IPv6) database web views render read-only JSON and NO web handler dispatches an inject command (AC-22/R-6).
# PREVENTS: a regression in the OSPF debug/introspection surface.
#
# Live FRR/QEMU multicast convergence is owned by the ospf-debug-*-frr interop scenarios.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/component/web -run 'TestOSPFOpaqueWebView|TestOSPFv3DatabaseWebView|TestNoInjectWebRoute|TestNoV3InjectWebRoute' -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=TestOSPFOpaqueWebView
expect=stdout:contains=TestOSPFv3DatabaseWebView
expect=stdout:contains=TestNoInjectWebRoute
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
